  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Would like the \"maximum shown avatars\" culling slider to be increased from 30 avatars up to 75 avatars max. I constantly switch between  \"show all avatars\" and \"show a max of 30 avatars\" in club worlds for performance reasons. I'd like an option where I could set a max of 50 avatars nearest to me. That way, in club worlds, I can fill up the dance floor area with 50 avatars nearest to me without having to fully commit to showing every avatar in the server (which can be 80+ avatars sometimes). This just gives players more control over their situation.",
